  "description": "Riyun Adinmir grew up being regarded as the disgrace of the perfect Adinmir family, a fact that deeply shaped her perception of herself. Constantly comparing herself to her relatives and those around her, Riyun considers herself twisted and flawed. Despite this, after three years of suppressing her temperament and enduring life at the Academy, her true character eventually comes to light. However, the consequences take an unexpected turn, diverging from what Riyun had envisioned.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
